    <node id="&quot;GUILLAUME LE GENTIL DE LA GALAISIÈRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Guillaume le Gentil de la Galaisière is a 18th-century French astronomer whose expeditions were based on recording the transit of Venus to estimate the distance between Earth and the Sun."</data>
